{"Incorrect metric recording functions are being used - recordLegacyDuration is called for primary storage operation errors instead of recordStorageDuration, causing misattribution of operation failures/latencies to the wrong storage system": 0.9954581260681152, "Metric cardinality explosion in Delete operation - recordStorageDuration is called with resource `name` for the `kind` label instead of `options.Kind`, creating a new Prometheus time series for every unique resource name": 0.9896671772003174, "Undefined variable `p` is used in multiple test functions (TestMode3_Create, TestMode3_List, TestMode3_Delete, TestMode3_DeleteCollection, and TestMode3_Update), causing compilation errors - need to initialize Prometheus registry variable `p` before using it with NewDualWriter": 0.8746843934059143, "Dependency conflict with breaking changes - PR introduces transitive dependency on go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric v0.39.0 while project uses v1.26.0, which will cause runtime errors due to breaking API changes between major versions": 0.08393657207489014, "10-second timeout for legacy operations is hardcoded and duplicated across Create, Delete, Update, and DeleteCollection methods - should be extracted into a shared constant to prevent configuration drift": 0.4386354088783264, "Unconditional t.Skip() prevents test execution for 'with dual write (etcd, mode 3)' test case, making subsequent test setup and execution logic dead code with no test coverage for etcd storage backend with mode 3 dual-write functionality": 0.5154145956039429}